        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Asbury%2C_Iowa"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Asbury’s colorful past is especially vivid in the era before automobiles reshaped life.",
